        "closed_at": null,
        "author_association": "NONE",
        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "body": "### Operating System\n\nWindows 11 Home\n\n### HOI4 version\n\n1.15.3\n\n### TNO version\n\nThe New Order: Last Days of Europe - v1.7.0 \"Operation Deep Freeze\"\n\n### Do you have other mods in use?\n\nTNO Radio\n\n### Were you using Steam?\n\nYes\n\n### Which major expansions do you NOT have?\n\nI have all\n\n### Files\n\n[USA_1966_05_20_06.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18285792/USA_1966_05_20_06.zip)\r\nAbove is the raw save file a few weeks before Indonesia capitulates.\r\n\r\n[Testing Capping.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18285794/Testing.Capping.zip)\r\nThis is me cheating some paratroopers to speed up the end of the war while I was testing solutions.\r\n\r\n[Test Cap 2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18285793/Test.Cap.2.zip)\r\nThis is just further cheats so within 6 hours of booting up the last tag will capitulate.\r\n\n\n### Describe the bug\n\nThe victory events for the Indonesian Civil War don't seem to be working. I experimented with altering the actual code itself but nothing worked. I looked online and it seems like on_capitulation has been bugged for a good two years for faction based wars (maybe Faction to Faction wars? Since South Africa seemed to have worked fine).\r\nhttps://forum.paradoxplaza.com/forum/threads/hoi-4-1-12-5-18aa-scripted-on_action-on_capitulation-has-been-broken-in-wars-involving-factions.1565100/\r\n\r\nFor Kaiserreich I know we moved a lot of our on_capitulation on_actions to on_capitulation_immediate, which has basically the same effect but less buggy. This theoretically would be a quick, one line fix. \r\n\r\nOne other suggestion I'd recommend in the long term is moving a lot of the effects for ending conflicts to an event fired by the on_action, so players who do experience bugs with the on_action file can console fire said event rather than continue the game with no way of triggering the effect that failed to fire.\n\n### Steps to reproduce / Cause of the issue\n\n1. Boot up any of the saves attached\r\n2. Wait for the INS war to end\r\n\r\nSee my explanation above for the likely cause of the issue.\n\n### Expected behaviour\n\nThe Indonesian Civil War ending effect should fire.\n\n### Screenshots\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
