        "closed_at": null,
        "author_association": "NONE",
        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "body": "As an user, I know OVH support can change the mitigation profile for an IP address. I want to be able to change a mitigation profile or certain pre-defined rate-limits for each of my IP addresses myself.\r\n\r\nIt happends a lot were an attack causes the VAC to drop legit traffic because it reaches a certain limit. I want more flexibility and possibly fix it myself before I have to contact the support. Something similar is already implemented for the GAME server line-up.\r\n\r\nAdditionally it would be nice if I can see which profile is active for which IP in my manager, even if the support changed the profile or its limits.",
