    "payload": {
      "repository_id": 679553008,
      "push_id": 21933366874,
      "size": 6,
      "distinct_size": 4,
      "ref": "refs/heads/PCO-14-git-clone-protocol",
      "head": "73622e3ab381f0536b732eb7912eb2dc1b602bed",
      "before": "53444789fcd392ad57a4ab0a41190350fe0120fb",
      "commits": [
        {
          "sha": "b1aebab8ce9bcc99eb5f2a61cdf46f20fa0e9f84",
          "author": {
            "email": "alexanderilyin@users.noreply.github.com",
            "name": "Aleksandr Ilin"
          },
          "message": "feat: Improve PartCAD CLI and documentation (#246)\n\n* feat(devcontainer): Add GitGuardian shield and actionlint\n* feat: Reduce pytest and nox test timeouts\n\n- Add features/docs.feature to the repository.\n- Add pre-commit GitGuardian security scanning hook.\n- Reduce pytest and nox test timeouts to 10 minutes.\n- Temporarily disable ggshield pre-commit hook.\n- Update .gitignore to add .cache_ggshield.\n- Update .vscode/settings.json to disable format on save.\n- Update devcontainer.json to update cache mounts.\n- Update Dockerfile to install moreutils.\n- Update docstrings for clarity.\n- Update features/steps/partcad-cli/commands/version.py.\n- Update features/version.feature.\n- Update github workflows for timeout and various fixes.\n- Update partcad-cli/src/partcad_cli/click/command.py.\n- Update partcad-cli/src/partcad_cli/click/commands/inspect.py.\n- Update partcad-cli/src/partcad_cli/click/commands/supply/quote.py.\n- Update partcad/src/partcad/shape_ai.py.",
          "distinct": false,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/partcad/partcad/commits/b1aebab8ce9bcc99eb5f2a61cdf46f20fa0e9f84"
        },
        {
          "sha": "8ab76b7f71e05843f5ab939ae6ba1e8d0b2e32d3",
          "author": {
            "email": "openvmp@proton.me",
            "name": "PartCAD GitHub Action"
          },
          "message": "Version updated from 0.7.33 to 0.7.34",
          "distinct": false,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/partcad/partcad/commits/8ab76b7f71e05843f5ab939ae6ba1e8d0b2e32d3"
        },
        {
          "sha": "3012cb3b07be1776f1d8faee131b9b01b58cad6e",
          "author": {
            "email": "amhaznif@gmail.com",
            "name": "Amha Kindu"
          },
          "message": "feat(partcad): Support Git config parameters for cloning/pulling\n\nRefactor ProjectFactoryGit to pass git config parameters to git commands.  Added git config parameter to UserConfig class.  Enhanced git operations to use passed parameters.",
          "distinct": true,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/partcad/partcad/commits/3012cb3b07be1776f1d8faee131b9b01b58cad6e"
        },
        {
          "sha": "a9a032d7102fa0dac4690aece1f0b896ef00f1ac",
          "author": {
            "email": "amhaznif@gmail.com",
            "name": "Amha Kindu"
          },
          "message": "feat(import): Enhance Git import with config overrides and SSH support\n\nAdded SSH support for cloning repositories, improving speed and reliability.  Implemented configuration overrides for Git settings, like user name and email, and URL overrides.  Removed unnecessary use of environment variables for Git configurations.  Added explicit handling of import overrides from user configuration.  Improved documentation on installing dependencies and configuring Git settings.",
          "distinct": true,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/partcad/partcad/commits/a9a032d7102fa0dac4690aece1f0b896ef00f1ac"
        },
        {
          "sha": "ab95ad87558b424c9f151d04fd26d7a76bfd9f02",
          "author": {
            "email": "amhaznif@gmail.com",
            "name": "Amha Kindu"
          },
          "message": "feat(install): Add support for SSH and config overrides\n\nAdd scenarios for installing packages via SSH and overriding git configuration.  Also, implement a step for creating user configuration files.  This allows testing install scenarios with various configurations and git configurations. Added support for creating the .partcad directory within the user's home directory.",
          "distinct": true,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/partcad/partcad/commits/ab95ad87558b424c9f151d04fd26d7a76bfd9f02"
        },
        {
          "sha": "73622e3ab381f0536b732eb7912eb2dc1b602bed",
          "author": {
            "email": "amhaznif@gmail.com",
            "name": "Amha Kindu"
          },
          "message": "feat(docs): Update config import docs and improve install feature\n\nClarify config import process in docs, now including example.\n\nImprove install feature test to include checking for git user configs,\nnow using @wip rather than @success.\n\nUpdate install.feature to use @wip for scenario related to ssh\nand non-existent git packages.\n\nFix: Correctly quote config values in git clone command.\n\nFix: Update config.yaml import handling for better url overrides.\nImprove logging.",
          "distinct": true,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/partcad/partcad/commits/73622e3ab381f0536b732eb7912eb2dc1b602bed"
        }
      ]
