t/TypeScript) | `5.6.3` | `5.7.2` |\n\n\nUpdates `@astrojs/markdown-remark` from 6.0.0 to 6.0.1\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/releases\"><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code>'s releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code><a href=\"https://github.com/6\"><code>@​6</code></a>.0.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/12646\">#12646</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/f13417bfbf73130c224752379e2da33084f89554\"><code>f13417b</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! - Avoids parsing frontmatter that are not at the top of a file</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/12570\">#12570</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/87231b1168da66bb593f681206c42fa555dfcabc\"><code>87231b1</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/GrimLink\"><code>@​GrimLink</code></a>! - Removes trailing new line in code blocks to prevent generating a trailing empty <code>&lt;span /&gt;</code> tag</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/12664\">#12664</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/a71e9b93b317edc0ded49d4d50f1b7841c8cd428\"><code>a71e9b9</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! - Fixes frontmatter parsing if file is encoded in UTF8 with BOM</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/blob/main/packages/markdown/remark/CHANGELOG.md\"><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code>'s changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>6.0.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/12646\">#12646</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commi